<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 36pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .header-subtitle {
    font-size: 28pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .report-title {
    font-size: 24pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: right;
    margin-top: 150px;
  }
  .library-logo {
    float: right;
    margin-top: 150px;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 18pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #ccc;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .mission-content, .vision-content, .overview-content {
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .staff-list, .interns-list, .volunteers-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .staff-list li, .interns-list li, .volunteers-list li {
    padding: 5px 0;
  }
  .what-we-do-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .what-we-do-list li {
    padding: 8px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
  }
  .by-the-numbers-grid {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }
  .metric-box {
    width: 45%;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .metric-value {
    font-size: 48pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .metric-label {
    font-size: 12pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .department-highlights-list {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  .highlight-item {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-title">C.L. SONNICHSEN</div>
  <div class="header-subtitle">SPECIAL COLLECTIONS DEPARTMENT</div>
  <img src="placeholder_image.jpg" alt="Department Image" style="width: 100%; height: auto; margin-bottom: 40px;">
  <div class="report-title">ANNUAL<br>REPORT<br>FISCAL YEAR<br>{{ fiscal_year }}</div>
  <div class="library-logo">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="UTEP Library Logo" style="width: 150px;">
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-heading">Mission</div>
  <div class="mission-content">
    The Special Collections Department supports the University's mission of education, research, scholarship, and community service. The mission of the C.L. Sonnichsen Special Collections Department is to acquire, preserve, and make available for use the archival, rare book, and media collections of the University Library within the scope of the Department's collection policies. Areas of collection emphasis include primary sources for the history of the University, El Paso and the border region; fine printing and book design; and military history.
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">Vision</div>
  <div class="vision-content">
    The Library sits on a hill within sight of the Mexican border. Our unique position informs our attitudes and the services we offer. We aim for excellence in providing service to our users and in making our collections accessible.
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">Overview</div>
  <div class="overview-content">
    The collections contained in the C.L. Sonnichsen Special Collections Department directly support research and learning at the University of Texas at El Paso (UTEP). The Department has over <span data-field="total_archival_collections">{{ total_archival_collections }}</span> archival collections, over <span data-field="oral_histories_count">{{ oral_histories_count }}</span> oral histories, various rare book collections, and thematic book collections, such as the Southwest, Chicano, Judaica, Art, Military, and McCord Poetry collections.
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-heading">Staff</div>
  <ul class="staff-list">
    <li><span data-field="staff.head_name">{{ staff.head_name }}</span>, Head</li>
    <li><span data-field="staff.assistant_head_name">{{ staff.assistant_head_name }}</span>, Assistant Head</li>
    <li><span data-field="staff.photo_archivist_name">{{ staff.photo_archivist_name }}</span>, Photo Archivist</li>
    <li><span data-field="staff.imaging_specialist_name">{{ staff.imaging_specialist_name }}</span>, Imaging Specialist</li>
    <li><span data-field="staff.library_assistant_ii_name">{{ staff.library_assistant_ii_name }}</span>, Library Assistant II</li>
    <li><span data-field="staff.library_assistant_ii_name_2">{{ staff.library_assistant_ii_name_2 }}</span>, Library Assistant II</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="section-heading">Interns</div>
  <ul class="interns-list">
    <li><span data-field="interns[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ interns[loop.index0] }}</span></li>
    {% for item in interns %}
    <li><span data-field="interns[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ item }}</span></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <div class="section-heading">Volunteers</div>
  <ul class="volunteers-list">
    <li><span data-field="volunteers[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ volunteers[loop.index0] }}</span></li>
    {% for item in volunteers %}
    <li><span data-field="volunteers[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ item }}</span></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <img src="placeholder_building.jpg" alt="UTEP Building" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
  </div>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="section-heading" style="border-bottom: none;">What We Do</div>
      <ul class="what-we-do-list">
        <li>Reference</li>
        <li>Access services</li>
        <li>Archival management</li>
        <li>Preservation</li>
        <li>Exhibits</li>
        <li>Digitization</li>
        <li>Outreach activities</li>
        <li>Art collection management</li>
        <li>Library subject specialists</li>
        <li>Instruction and SPC orientations</li>
        <li>Grant-writing</li>
        <li>Special projects</li>
        <li>Professional service</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <!-- Placeholder for visual balance -->
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <img src="placeholder_campus.jpg" alt="Campus View" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
  </div>
  <div class="by-the-numbers-grid">
    <div class="metric-box">
      <span class="metric-value">{{ total_images_viewed }}</span>
      <span class="metric-label">IMAGES VIEWED ONLINE</span>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 5px;">(partially closed during the fiscal year due to Covid-19)</p>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-box">
      <span class="metric-value">{{ books_and_archival_collections_in_house }}</span>
      <span class="metric-label">BOOKS AND ARCHIVAL COLLECTIONS USED IN-HOUSE</span>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-box">
      <span class="metric-value">{{ oral_histories_used }}</span>
      <span class="metric-label">ORAL HISTORIES USED</span>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-box">
      <span class="metric-value">{{ reference_questions_answered }}</span>
      <span class="metric-label">REFERENCE QUESTIONS ANSWERED</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="section-heading">Department Highlights</div>
      <ul class="department-highlights-list">
        <li class="highlight-item"><span data-field="highlight_1">{{ highlight_1 }}</span></li>
        <li class="highlight-item"><span data-field="highlight_2">{{ highlight_2 }}</span></li>
        <li class="highlight-item"><span data-field="highlight_3">{{ highlight_3 }}</span></li>
        <li class="highlight-item"><span data-field="highlight_4">{{ highlight_4 }}</span></li>
        <li class="highlight-item"><span data-field="highlight_5">{{ highlight_5 }}</span></li>
        <li class="highlight-item"><span data-field="highlight_6">{{ highlight_6 }}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <!-- Placeholder for visual balance -->
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <img src="placeholder_book_cover.jpg" alt="Book Cover" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin: 0;">Published</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">November {{ publication_date }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 100px;">
        <img src="placeholder_exhibit.jpg" alt="Exhibit" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <img src="placeholder_book_cover_2.jpg" alt="Book Cover 2" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin: 0;">Literature and Landscape photo exhibit,</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Third Floor Gallery</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <!-- Placeholder for visual balance -->
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="section-heading">Department Highlights</div>
      <ul class="department-highlights-list">
        <li class="highlight-item"><span data-field="highlight_d1">{{ highlight_d1 }}</span></li>
        <li class="highlight-item"><span data-field="highlight_d2">{{ highlight_d2 }}</span></li>
        <li class="highlight-item"><span data-field="highlight_d3">{{ highlight_d3 }}</span></li>
        <li class="highlight-item"><span data-field="highlight_d4">{{ highlight_d4 }}</span></li>
        <li class="highlight-item"><span data-field="highlight_d5">{{ highlight_d5 }}</span></li>
        <li class="highlight-item"><span data-field="highlight_d6">{{ highlight_d6 }}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <!-- Placeholder for visual balance -->
