  </div>
</div>

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Synthetic Document</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
        .section-title { font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .list-item { margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .button-container { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; }
        .button {
            background-color: #ff9933;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: block;
            box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        .image-container { text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; }
        .image-container img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
        .contact-info p { margin: 5px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
        <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">In the Press</h1>
        <p style="font-size: 14pt;">El Paso History Radio Show, {{ date_1 }}</p>
        <p style="font-size: 14pt;">KTSM news features, {{ year_2 }}</p>
        <p style="font-size: 14pt;">Telewizja Polska (Polish public television news segment), {{ date_3 }}</p>
        <p style="font-size: 14pt;">Borderlands (El Paso Community College), Volume {{ volume_number }}, {{ year_4 }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="image-container">
        <img src="placeholder_image_1.jpg" alt="Photo">
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 28pt;">New to Special Collections</h2>
        <hr style="width: 50%; margin: 20px auto;">
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <div class="list-item">Tillie Krakauer Steffian Zork postcard album</div>
        <div class="list-item">Requiem for the Innocent photograph collection ({{ date_memorial }})</div>
        <div class="list-item">Charles Ambler papers</div>
        <div class="list-item">Colonel Forrest L. Martz papers</div>
        <div class="list-item">Viola Mary Hadlock Anderson photograph collection</div>
        <div class="list-item">Tompkins-Penfield postcard collection</div>
        <div class="list-item">1905 Miniatures El Paso and Juarez album</div>
    </div>
    <div class="image-container" style="margin-top: 50px;">
        <img src="placeholder_image_2.jpg" alt="Miniatures Album">
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 28pt;">Fun and Games</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 40px;">
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <div style="background-color: #ff9933; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Social Media</h3>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; margin-top: 10px;">
                    <span style="font-size: 30px;">&#9993;</span> <!-- Placeholder for Instagram icon -->
                    <span style="font-size: 30px;">&#128279;</span> <!-- Placeholder for Facebook icon -->
                </div>
                <p style="margin-top: 15px;">El Paso Women's History Coloring Books</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <div style="background-color: #ff9933; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Online Exhibits</h3>
                <p>Special Collections Jigsaw Puzzles</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <div style="background-color: #ff9933; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Special Collections Playlist on Spotify</h3>
                <span style="font-size: 30px;">&#9835;</span> <!-- Placeholder for Spotify icon -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 28pt;">Online Collections</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 40px;">
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <div style="background-color: #ff9933; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Image Collections</h3>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <div style="background-color: #ff9933; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Oral Histories</h3>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 30px;">
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <div style="background-color: #ff9933; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Special Collections on the Portal to Texas History</h3>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <div style="background-color: #ff9933; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Special Collections on ScholarWorks@UTEP</h3>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 28pt;">In Memorium</h2>
        <div class="image-container">
            <img src="placeholder_image_3.jpg" alt="Portrait">
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 20px;">{{ year_death }} - {{ year_birth }}</p>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <p>Our friend and former colleague, {{ full_name }}, passed away on {{ date_passing }}. {{ full_name }} was a librarian at UTEP for almost {{ years_service }} years in the Reference and Special Collections Departments. He was a celebrated collector of Latin American art and his collection is now at the {{ museum_name }} in {{ city_museum }}. The museum curated an exhibit featuring his collection and library last fall.</p>
        <p>{{ full_name }} loved art, books, riding his bicycle, and going out to eat with friends. He also enjoyed his annual trips to {{ city_trip }} and helping generations of students at UTEP.</p>
        <p>After his passing, many people paid tribute to {{ full_name }} on social media and in the local news.</p>
        <p>Special Collections held an online memorial for {{ full_name }} via Zoom in {{ month_memorial }} and his nephew, {{ nephew_name }}, hosted a memorial fiesta for {{ full_name }} on {{ date_fiesta }} at {{ location_fiesta }}'s Desert Crossing.</p>
        <p>He is very much missed.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
        <img src="placeholder_image_4.jpg" alt="University Building">
        <h2 style="font-size: 28pt; margin-top: 20px;">C.L. SONNICHSEN SPECIAL COLLECTIONS DEPARTMENT</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-info" style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <p>Sixth Floor</p>
        <p>UTEP Library</p>
        <p>{{ street_address }}</p>
        <p>{{ city_state_zip }}</p>
        <p>Phone: {{ phone_number }}</p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:{{ email_address }}">{{ email_address }}</a></p>
        <p>Website: <a href="{{ website_url }}">{{ website_url }}</a></p>
        <p>Report created by {{ creator_name }}</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">
        <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="UTEP Library Logo" style="max-width: 200px;">
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>